;--1:#403F53"> ChildSlot.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">ColorFiltered</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">colorFilter: ColorFilter,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">content: ColorFiltered.() </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">-></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Unit </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {},</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="fun ChildSlot.ColorFiltered(    colorFilter: ColorFilter,    content: ColorFiltered.() -> Unit = {},)"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="参数" __collectHeading="true">参数</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#参数"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “参数”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>colorFilter</code></td><td>Skia ColorFilter 实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>最多一个子 Widget</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="示例" __collectHeading="true">示例</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#示例"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “示例”</span></a></div><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">val</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> filter </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> ColorFilter.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">makeBlend</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(Color.RED, BlendMode.MODULATE)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code">
+</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">ColorFiltered</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(colorFilter </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> filter) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">RawImage</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(image </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> sourceImage)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="val filter = ColorFilter.makeBlend(Color.RED, BlendMode.MODULATE)ColorFiltered(colorFilter = filter) {    RawImage(image = sourceImage)}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p><code>MODULATE</code> 会逐通道相乘。不同 BlendMode 的语义由 Skia 定义，测试时应采样确定性区域，不要只依赖肉眼判断。</p><p>ColorFiltered 改变的是最终颜色，不改变布局、尺寸和命中区域。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="绘制边界" __collectHeading="true">绘制边界</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#绘制边界"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “绘制边界”</span></a></div><p>滤镜的输入来自子树；要过滤已经绘制在后方的内容，使用 <a href="/widgets/painting/backdrop-filter/">BackdropFilter</a>。当子树的绘制边界可确定时，ColorFiltered 会将作用范围限制在该边界内，避免小组件给整个画布染色。</p><p>绘制边界可以大于布局尺寸：合法的溢出、变换后的内容、装饰阴影和文字阴影仍会参与滤镜。<code>SRC</code>、<code>MULTIPLY</code> 等可能改变透明像素的混合模式，也可能给边界内原本透明的间隙着色；它们并非只作用于不透明像素。</p><p>如果子树中有通用 <code>ImageFiltered</code>，需要提供适合图像滤镜的 <code>outputBounds</code>，让外层 ColorFiltered 知道输出范围。无法安全估算边界时会保留不裁剪回退，某些混合模式仍可能影响整个画布。高斯模糊的配置示例见 <a href="/widgets/painting/image-filtered/#%E4%B8%8E-colorfiltered-%E5%B5%8C%E5%A5%97">ImageFiltered</a>。</p><p>内置组件会估算自身的绘制范围；自定义渲染对象若在尺寸外绘制，或子树包含读取背景的 BackdropFilter，应验证结果并在需要时用 ClipRect 等组件明确限定作用区域。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/widgets/painting/opacity/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17 11H9.41l3.3-3.29a1.004 1.004 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-5 5a1 1 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 0 .76 1 1 0 0 0 .21.33l5 5a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 1.639-.325 1 1 0 0 0-.219-1.095L9.41 13H17a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">上一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">Opacity</span></span></a><a href="/widgets/painting/image-filtered/" rel="next" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17.92 11.62a1.001 1.001 0 0 0-.21-.33l-5-5a1.003 1.003 0 1 0-1.42 1.42l3.3 3.29H7a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h7.59l-3.3 3.29a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 .325 1.639 1 1 0 0 0 1.095-.219l5-5a1 1 0 0 0 .21-.33 1 1 0 0 0 0-.76Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">下一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">ImageFiltered</span></span></a></div></footer></div></div></main></div></div></div></div><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentW