Filter: ImageFilter,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">outputBounds: ((Rect) -> Rect)? </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#FF6A83;--1:#A24848">null</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">content: ImageFiltered.() </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">-></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Unit </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {},</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="fun ChildSlot.ImageFiltered(    imageFilter: ImageFilter,    outputBounds: ((Rect) -> Rect)? = null,    content: ImageFiltered.() -> Unit = {},)"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="参数" __collectHeading="true">参数</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#参数"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “参数”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>imageFilter</code></td><td>Skia ImageFilter 实例</td></tr><tr><td><code>outputBounds</code></td><td>默认 <code>null</code>；将子树的输入绘制矩形映射为滤镜完整输出矩形，供外层 ColorFiltered 计算作用范围</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>最多一个子 Widget</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">ImageFiltered</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">imageFilter </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> ImageFilter.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">makeBlur</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">8f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">8f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, FilterTileMode.CLAMP),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">RawImage</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(image </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> sourceImage)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="ImageFiltered(    imageFilter = ImageFilter.makeBlur(8f, 8f, FilterTileMode.CLAMP),) {    RawImage(image = sourceImage)}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>它处理的是自身子树；要处理已经绘制在后方的内容，使用 <a href="/widgets/painting/backdrop-filter/">BackdropFilter</a>。模糊会扩展可见像素范围，祖先裁剪可能截掉模糊边缘。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="与-colorfiltered-嵌套" __collectHeading="true">与 ColorFiltered 嵌套</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#与-colorfiltered-嵌套"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “与 ColorFiltered 嵌套”</span></a></div><p>Skiko 的通用 <code>ImageFilter</code> 不提供可查询的输出边界。将 ImageFiltered 放在 ColorFiltered 内时，可通过 <code>outputBounds</code> 提供滤镜的完整输出范围，避免外层颜色滤镜影响边界之外的背景。高斯模糊可使用 <code>com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.blurImageFilterBounds</code>：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">ColorFiltered</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(colorFilter </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> ColorFilter.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">makeBlend</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(Color.RED, BlendMode.MULTIPLY)) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">ImageFiltered</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">imageFilter </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> ImageFilter.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">makeBlur</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">2f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">2f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, FilterTileMode.CLAMP),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">outputBounds </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">blurImageFilterBounds</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">2f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">2f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Container</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(width </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">20f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, height </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">20f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Color.BLUE)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="ColorFiltered(colorFilter = ColorFilter.makeBlend(Color.RED, BlendMode.MULTIPLY)) {    ImageFiltered(        imageFilter = ImageFilter.makeBlur(2f, 2f, FilterTileMode.CLAMP),        outputBounds = blurImageFilterBounds(2f, 2f),    ) {        Container(width = 20f, height = 20f, color = Color.BLUE)    }}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p><code>blurImageFilterBounds(sigmaX, sigmaY)</code> 要求两个 sigma 有限且非负，并分别按 <code>ceil(3 × sigma)</code> 向两侧扩张输入矩形。这里的 <code>Rect</code> 是 <code>org.jetbrains.skia.Rect</code>，坐标相对于 ImageFiltered 本地坐标系。</p><p>其他滤镜可使用 <code>outputBounds = { input -&gt; /* 返回完整输出矩形 */ }</code>。回调应无副作用，并返回覆盖滤镜全部输出的有限矩形；范围过小会截断效果，过大则可能让更多透明区域被外层颜色滤镜着色。未提供或无法确定有效边界时会保留不裁剪回退；需要固定作用区域时，可在外层添加 ClipRect 等裁剪组件。</p><p><code>outputBounds</code> 只用于外层颜色滤镜计算边界，不改变 ImageFiltered 单独使用时的裁剪行为。Parser 的 <code>&lt;ImageFiltered&gt;</code> 固定为高斯模糊，会根据 <code>sigmaX</code>、<code>sigmaY</code> 自动提供该边界，无需额外设置属性。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/widgets/painting/color-filtered/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17 11H9.41l3.3-3.29a1.004 1.004 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-5 5a1 1 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 0 .76 1 1 0 0 0 .21.33l5 5a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 1.639-.325 1 1 0 0 0-.219-1.095L9.41 13H17a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">上一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class