span></a></li><li style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><a href="#dsl-与解析器共用一套模型" style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd"><span style="--depth: 0;" class="astro-ng4v3drd">DSL 与解析器共用一套模型</span></a></li></ul></nav></starlight-toc><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/TableOfContents.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.Csloo1VZ.js"></script></div></div></div></aside><div class="main-pane astro-aak7uwzb"><main data-pagefind-body class="astro-7jrn6cqt" lang="zh-CN" dir="ltr"><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><h1 id="_top" class="astro-grsobg4o">核心概念</h1></div></div><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-markdown-content"><article><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="一条清晰的渲染管线" __collectHeading="true">一条清晰的渲染管线</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#一条清晰的渲染管线"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “一条清晰的渲染管线”</span></a></div><div class="expressive-code"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ec.w36nc.css"><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js"></script><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="text"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#d6deeb;--1:#403f53">Widget 树 → RenderBox 树 → 布局尺寸 → Skia Canvas → PNG / JPEG / WebP</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="Widget 树 → RenderBox 树 → 布局尺寸 → Skia Canvas → PNG / JPEG / WebP"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p><code>Widget</code> 是描述配置，<code>RenderBox</code> 是布局与绘制的执行体。调用 <code>SnapshotPNG</code> 时，Snapshot 会先创建 RenderBox 树，再从根节点开始传递约束，最后根据布局结果创建 Surface 并绘制。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="widget-树" __collectHeading="true">Widget 树</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#widget-树"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “Widget 树”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>子节点</th><th>典型组件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>单子节点</td><td>1 个</td><td><code>Container</code>、<code>Padding</code>、<code>Align</code></td></tr><tr><td>多子节点</td><td>任意个</td><td><code>Row</code>、<code>Column</code>、<code>Stack</code>、<code>IndexedStack</code></td></tr><tr><td>叶子节点</td><td>0 个</td><td><code>Text</code>、<code>RawImage</code>、<code>CachedNetworkImage</code></td></tr><tr><td>父布局参数</td><td>0 或 1 个</td><td><code>Expanded</code>、<code>Flexible</code>、<code>Spacer</code>、<code>Positioned</code></td></tr></tbody></table><aside aria-label="父布局参数不能脱离对应父节点" class="starlight-aside starlight-aside--caution"><p class="starlight-aside__title" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="starlight-aside__icon astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1em;"><path d="M12 16a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm10.67 1.47-8.05-14a3 3 0 0 0-5.24 0l-8 14A3 3 0 0 0 3.94 22h16.12a3 3 0 0 0 2.61-4.53Zm-1.73 2a1 1 0 0 1-.88.51H3.94a1 1 0 0 1-.88-.51 1 1 0 0 1 0-1l8-14a1 1 0 0 1 1.78 0l8.05 14a1 1 0 0 1 .05 1.02v-.02ZM12 8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0V9a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Z"/></svg>父布局参数不能脱离对应父节点</p><div class="starlight-aside__content"><p><code>Positioned</code> 只能作为 <code>Stack</code> 或 <code>IndexedStack</code> 的直接子级；<code>Expanded</code>、<code>Flexible</code> 和 <code>Spacer</code> 只能作为 <code>Row</code>、<code>Column</code> 或 <code>Flex</code> 的直接子级。放错层级会导致 parentData 类型错误。</p></div></aside><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h3"><h3 id="childslot-与挂载规则" __collectHeading="true">ChildSlot 与挂载规则</h3><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#childslot-与挂载规则"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “ChildSlot 与挂载规则”</span></a></div><p>DSL 函数的接收者是 <code>ChildSlot</code>，只有能接受子节点的 Widget 才实现它。这样可以在编译期阻止把子节点挂到 <code>RawImage</code> 等叶子节点上。</p><p>单子节点和多子节点都通过 <code>attach(child)</code> 建树。重复占用单子槽位会抛出异常；自定义组合函数应声明为：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">fun</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> ChildSlot.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">profileCard</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">() {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Container</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> { </span><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">/* ... */</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> }</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="fun ChildSlot.profileCard() {    Container { /* ... */ }}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><aside aria-label="编写自定义组合函数" class="starlight-aside starlight-aside--tip"><p class="starlight-aside__title" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="starlight-aside__icon astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1em;"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.44 8.855v-.001l3.527-3.516c.34-.344.802-.541 1.285-.548h6.649l.947-.947c3.07-3.07 6.207-3.072 7.62-2.868a1.821 1.821 0 0 1 1.557 1.557c.204 1.413.203 4.55-2.868 7.62l-.946.946v6.649a1.845 1.845 0 0 1-.549 1.286l-3.516 3.528a1.844 1.844 0 0 1-3.11-.944l-.858-4.275-4.52-4.52-2.31-.463-1.964-.394A1.847 1.847 0 0 1 .98 10.693a1.843 1.843 0 0 1 .46-1.838Zm5.379 2.017-3.873-.776L6.32 6.733h4.638l-4.14 4.14Zm8.403-5.655c2.459-2.46 4.856-2.463 5.89-2.33.134 1.035.13 3.432-2.329 5.891l-6.71 6.71-3.561-3.56 6.71-6.711Zm-1.318 15.837-.776-3.873 4.14-4.14v4.639l-3.364 3.374Z" clip-rule="evenodd"/><path d="M9.318 18.345a.972.972 0 0 0-1.86-.561c-.482 1.435-1.687 2.204-2.934 2.619a8.22 8.22 0 0 1-1.23.302c.062-.365.157-.79.303-1.229.415-1.247 1.184-2.452 2.62-2.935a.971.971 0 1 0-.62-1.842c-.12.04-.236.084-.35.13-2.02.828-3.012 2.588-3.493 4.033a10.383 10.383 0 0 0-.51 2.845l-.001.016v.063c0 .536.434.972.97.972H2.24a7.21 7.21 0 0 0 .878-.065c.527-.063 1.248-.19 2.02-.447 1.445-.48 3.205-1.472 4.033-3.494a5.828 5.828 0 0 0 .147-.407Z"/></svg>编写自定义组合函数</p><div class="starlight-aside__content"><p>接收者应使用 <code>ChildSlot</code>，不要写成普通 <code>Widget</code>，否则函数内部无法调用 DSL 挂载函数。</p></div></aside><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h3"><h3 id="parentdatawidget" __collectHeading="true">ParentDataWidget</h3><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#parentdatawidget"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “ParentDataWidget”</span></a></div><p><code>Expanded</code>、<code>Flexible</code>、<code>Positioned</code> 不创建独立 RenderBox，而是把数据写入子 RenderBox 的 parentData。父级 Flex 或 Stack 在布局时读取这些数据。这就是它们必须作为对应父节点直接子级的原因。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="约束模型" __collectHeading="true">约束模型</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#约束模型"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “约束模型”</span></a></div><p>父节点向子节点下发 <code>BoxConstraints</code>，子节点在约束允许的范围内决定尺寸，父节点再决定它的位置。常用约束包括：</p><ul><li><code>BoxConstraints.tight(size)</code>：宽高都锁定；</li><li><code>BoxConstraints.loose(size)</code>：最大尺寸确定，最小尺寸为 0；</li><li><code>BoxConstraints.expand(width, height)</code>：尽可能填满；</li><li><code>BoxConstraints()</code>：完全放开，根节点使用时要确保最终尺寸有限。</li></ul><p>这也是图片尺寸由内容决定的原因：Surface 会使用根 RenderBox 的布局尺寸，并向上取整为像素。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="布局绘制和图层" __collectHeading="true">布局、绘制和图层</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#布局绘制和图层"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “布局、绘制和图层”</span></a></div><p>布局只计算几何信息，不产生像素。绘制阶段由 RenderBox 把指令记录到 PaintingContext；透明度、滤镜、变换和裁剪等效果可能形成 Layer，最后统一合成到 Canvas。</p><p>这种分层意味着：</p><ul><li><code>layoutWidget</code> 可以脱离图片编码单独测试；</li><li>Transform 可以改变绘制位置，但不会重新改变父布局尺寸；</li><li>Opacity 和 Filter 可能触发离屏合成；</li><li>裁剪发生在绘制阶段，不会让子节点重新布局。</li></ul><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="颜色尺寸与坐标" __collectHeading="true">颜色、尺寸与坐标</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#颜色尺寸与坐标"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “颜色、尺寸与坐标”</span></a></div><ul><li>颜色使用 ARGB Int：<code>0xAARRGGBB</code>；</li><li>尺寸与坐标使用 Float 逻辑像素；</li><li>最终 Surface 宽高向上取整；</li><li><code>EdgeInsets</code> 表示四边空间；</li><li><code>Offset</code>、<code>Size</code>、<code>Rect</code>、<code>Radius</code> 和 <code>Matrix44CMO</code> 位于 <code>com.muedsa.geometry</code>；</li><li>浮点测试应使用容差，不应直接比较复杂计算后的精确值。</li></ul><p><code>Offset</code>（以及继承它的 <code>Size</code>）不再实现 <code>Comparable</code>，不能直接使用 <code>&lt;</code>、<code>&lt;=</code>、<code>&gt;</code>、<code>&gt;=</code> 比较二维值。请使用逐分量比较方法 <code>lessThan</code>、<code>lessThanOrEqual</code>、<code>greaterThan</code>、<code>greaterThanOrEqual</code>：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">val</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> fits </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Size</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">100f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">80f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) lessThanOrEqual </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Size</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">100f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">120f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) </span><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5D6376">// true</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="val fits = Size(100f, 80f) lessThanOrEqual Size(100f, 120f) // true"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>这类比较要求两个分量都满足条件；一轴更大、另一轴更小时，两个方向的比较都可能为 <code>false</code>。如果只关心一个轴，应直接比较 <code>x</code> / <code>y</code> 或 <code>width</code> / <code>height</code>。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="对齐与方向" __collectHeading="true">对齐与方向</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#对齐与方向"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “对齐与方向”</span></a></div><p><code>BoxAlignment(x, y)</code> 中，<code>(-1,-1)</code> 为左上，<code>(0,0)</code> 为中心，<code>(1,1)</code> 为右下。<code>AlignmentDirectional</code> 使用 start/end，需要结合 LTR 或 RTL 方向解析。</p><p>方向会同时影响 Flex 排列、Stack 的 directional alignment 和文本段落，因此服务端渲染多语言内容时应显式传递方向。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="dsl-与解析器共用一套模型" __collectHeading="true">DSL 与解析器共用一套模型</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#dsl-与解析器共用一套模型"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “DSL 与解析器共用一套模型”</span></a></div><p>Kotlin DSL 和类 DOM 解析器只是两种输入方式，最终都会得到同一套 Widget 树：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">SnapshotPNG</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Column</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"Snapshot"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Row</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> { </span><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">/* ... */</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> }</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="SnapshotPNG {    Column {        Text(&#x22;Snapshot&#x22;)        Row { /* ... */ }    }}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="xml"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Snapshot</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Column</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">Snapshot</span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Row</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA"> /></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Column</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Snapshot</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="<Snapshot>  <Column>    <Text>Snapshot</Text>    <Row />  </Column></Snapshot>"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>Parser 只负责把文本变成同一套 Widget 配置；约束规则、布局算法、绘制顺序和异常仍由 core 决定。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/guides/rendering/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17 11H9.41l3.3-3.29a1.004 1.004 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-5 5a1 1 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 0 .76 1 1 0 0 0 .21.33l5 5a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 1.639-.325 1 1 0 0 0-.219-1.095L9.41 13H17a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">上一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">渲染入口与输出</span></span></a><a href="/guides/layout/" rel="next" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17.92 11.62a1.001 1.001 0 0 0-.21-.33l-5-5a1.003 1.003 0 1 0-1.42 1.42l3.3 3.29H7a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h7.59l-3.3 3.29a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 .325 1.639 1 1 0 0 0 1.095-.219l5-5a1 1 0 0 0 .21-.33 1 1 0 0 0 0-.76Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">下一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">约束、布局与调试</span></span></a></div></footer></div></div></main></div></div></div></div><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a4546d15fc840d12',t:'MTc5MTExOTQxOQ=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else