ta-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “结构化 Bento 仪表盘”</span></a></div><p>使用 <code>Container</code>、<code>Row</code>、<code>Column</code>、<code>Stack</code> 和 <code>Positioned</code> 组合复杂布局，同时展示渐变、圆角、阴影、裁剪与内置字体。</p><p><img src="/showcase/showcase_dashboard.png" alt="由 Snapshot Widget 树生成的结构化 Bento 仪表盘"/></p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h3"><h3 id="霓虹视觉海报" __collectHeading="true">霓虹视觉海报</h3><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#霓虹视觉海报"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “霓虹视觉海报”</span></a></div><p>通过线性、径向和扫描渐变叠加几何图形，再结合透明度、旋转变换和排版生成完整海报。</p><p><img src="/showcase/showcase_poster.png" alt="由 Snapshot 生成的霓虹视觉海报"/></p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h3"><h3 id="类-dom-数据卡片" __collectHeading="true">类 DOM 数据卡片</h3><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#类-dom-数据卡片"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></sp