tro-7jrn6cqt" lang="zh-CN" dir="ltr"><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><h1 id="_top" class="astro-grsobg4o">Widget 与布局</h1></div></div><div class="content-panel astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-container astro-vdatg63d"><div class="sl-markdown-content"><article><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="布局组件" __collectHeading="true">布局组件</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#布局组件"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “布局组件”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>Widget</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/container/"><code>Container</code></a></td><td>尺寸、内外边距、底色、装饰、对齐与裁剪的组合组件</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/sized-box/"><code>SizedBox</code></a></td><td>强制宽度或高度</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/aspect-ratio/"><code>AspectRatio</code></a> / <a href="/widgets/layout/fractionally-sized-box/"><code>FractionallySizedBox</code></a></td><td>按宽高比或父约束比例确定尺寸</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/unconstrained-box/"><code>UnconstrainedBox</code></a></td><td>解除传给子节点的约束</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/padding/"><code>Padding</code></a></td><td>为单个子节点增加内边距</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/align/"><code>Align</code></a> / <a href="/widgets/layout/center/"><code>Center</code></a></td><td>控制子节点在盒子内的位置</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/row/"><code>Row</code></a> / <a href="/widgets/layout/column/"><code>Column</code></a></td><td>一维横向或纵向布局</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/stack/"><code>Stack</code></a></td><td>多个子节点层叠布局</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/indexed-stack/"><code>IndexedStack</code></a></td><td>只绘制指定索引的子节点</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/positioned/"><code>Positioned</code></a></td><td>在 <code>Stack</code> 中按边距或尺寸定位</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/expanded/"><code>Expanded</code></a> / <a href="/widgets/layout/flexible/"><code>Flexible</code></a></td><td>在 Flex 主轴上分配剩余空间</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/widgets/layout/spacer/"><code>Spacer</code></a></td><td>以权重填充 Flex 剩余空间</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="完整-widget-分类" __collectHeading="true">完整 Widget 分类</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#完整-widget-分类"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “完整 Widget 分类”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>分类</th><th>Widget</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>约束</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/sized-box/"><code>SizedBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/aspect-ratio/"><code>AspectRatio</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/fractionally-sized-box/"><code>FractionallySizedBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/unconstrained-box/"><code>UnconstrainedBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/constrained-box/"><code>ConstrainedBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/limited-box/"><code>LimitedBox</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>溢出</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/overflow-box/"><code>OverflowBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/sized-overflow-box/"><code>SizedOverflowBox</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>间距与对齐</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/padding/"><code>Padding</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/align/"><code>Align</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/center/"><code>Center</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>Flex</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/flex/"><code>Flex</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/row/"><code>Row</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/column/"><code>Column</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/expanded/"><code>Expanded</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/flexible/"><code>Flexible</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/spacer/"><code>Spacer</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>层叠</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/stack/"><code>Stack</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/indexed-stack/"><code>IndexedStack</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/positioned/"><code>Positioned</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>变换</td><td><a href="/widgets/layout/transform/"><code>Transform</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>颜色与装饰</td><td><a href="/widgets/painting/colored-box/"><code>ColoredBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/decorated-box/"><code>DecoratedBox</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/container/"><code>Container</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>合成效果</td><td><a href="/widgets/painting/opacity/"><code>Opacity</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/color-filtered/"><code>ColorFiltered</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/image-filtered/"><code>ImageFiltered</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/backdrop-filter/"><code>BackdropFilter</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>裁剪</td><td><a href="/widgets/painting/clip-rect/"><code>ClipRect</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/clip-rrect/"><code>ClipRRect</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/clip-oval/"><code>ClipOval</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/painting/clip-path/"><code>ClipPath</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>图片</td><td><a href="/widgets/image/raw-image/"><code>RawImage</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/image/provider-image/"><code>ProviderImage</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/image/cached-network-image/"><code>CachedNetworkImage</code></a></td></tr><tr><td>文本与行内对象</td><td><a href="/widgets/text/text/"><code>Text</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/text/rich-text/"><code>RichText</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/text/widget-span/"><code>WidgetSpan</code></a>、<a href="/widgets/text/image-emoji-span/"><code>ImageEmojiSpan</code></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p>以上每个链接都对应一个独立 API 页面，包含用途、当前源码签名、参数、布局或绘制行为、完整示例与注意事项。<code>TextSpan</code> 是 <code>RichText</code> 使用的行内内容模型，而不是 Widget；它的继承和组合方式在 <a href="/widgets/text/rich-text/">RichText</a> 页面中说明。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="container-参数" __collectHeading="true">Container 参数</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#container-参数"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “Container 参数”</span></a></div><table><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>alignment</code></td><td>子节点在盒内的对齐</td></tr><tr><td><code>padding</code></td><td>装饰内部与子节点之间的空间</td></tr><tr><td><code>color</code></td><td>简单背景色，不能与 decoration 同时使用</td></tr><tr><td><code>decoration</code></td><td>背景装饰</td></tr><tr><td><code>foregroundDecoration</code></td><td>子节点上方的前景装饰</td></tr><tr><td><code>width</code> / <code>height</code></td><td>收紧对应维度</td></tr><tr><td><code>constraints</code></td><td>额外 BoxConstraints</td></tr><tr><td><code>margin</code></td><td>容器外部空间</td></tr><tr><td><code>transform</code> / <code>transformAlignment</code></td><td>绘制变换及中心</td></tr><tr><td><code>clipBehavior</code></td><td>按 decoration 路径裁剪</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Container 适合组合式写法，但在排查布局时，拆成 <code>Padding</code>、<code>ConstrainedBox</code>、<code>DecoratedBox</code> 等原子 Widget 往往更容易理解。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="约束-widget" __collectHeading="true">约束 Widget</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#约束-widget"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “约束 Widget”</span></a></div><ul><li><code>SizedBox(width, height)</code>：把指定维度收紧；未指定维度继续服从父约束；</li><li><code>ConstrainedBox(constraints)</code>：把额外约束与父约束合并；</li><li><code>LimitedBox(maxWidth, maxHeight)</code>：只有父级对应维度无限时才生效；</li><li><code>OverflowBox</code>：允许子节点使用与父级不同的最小/最大约束；</li><li><code>SizedOverflowBox</code>：自身尺寸固定，子节点可以按另一套约束绘制到外部。</li></ul><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="rowcolumn-与-flex" __collectHeading="true">Row、Column 与 Flex</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#rowcolumn-与-flex"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “Row、Column 与 Flex”</span></a></div><p><code>Row</code> 主轴水平、<code>Column</code> 主轴垂直。<code>mainAxisAlignment</code> 控制主轴分布，<code>crossAxisAlignment</code> 控制交叉轴位置，<code>mainAxisSize</code> 决定自身在主轴上尽量大还是尽量小。</p><p>基线对齐需要 <code>crossAxisAlignment = BASELINE</code> 和非空 <code>textBaseline</code>。在无界主轴内使用 Expanded 会导致无法分配剩余空间，应先由父节点建立有限尺寸。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="stack-与-positioned" __collectHeading="true">Stack 与 Positioned</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#stack-与-positioned"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “Stack 与 Positioned”</span></a></div><p>Stack 适合覆盖层、角标、绝对定位和背景叠加。非 Positioned 子节点先参与 Stack 尺寸计算，Positioned 再根据边和尺寸放置。</p><p>同一轴上最多提供两项，例如 <code>left + right</code> 推导宽度，或 <code>left + width</code> 推导右侧位置。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="绘制与装饰" __collectHeading="true">绘制与装饰</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#绘制与装饰"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “绘制与装饰”</span></a></div><p><code>DecoratedBox</code> 与 <code>Container</code> 支持圆角、边框、阴影和渐变；<code>Opacity</code>、<code>ColorFiltered</code>、<code>ImageFiltered</code> 和 <code>BackdropFilter</code> 用于图层处理。<code>ClipRect</code>、<code>ClipRRect</code>、<code>ClipOval</code> 和 <code>ClipPath</code> 可以限制绘制范围。</p><div class="expressive-code"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ec.w36nc.css"><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js"></script><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">SnapshotPNG</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Container</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">width </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">480f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">height </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">280f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">padding </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> EdgeInsets.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">all</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">24f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">decoration </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">BoxDecoration</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">            </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Color.WHITE,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">            </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">borderRadius </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> BorderRadius.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">circular</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">24f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">        </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Column</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"A structured image"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">SizedBox</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(height </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">12f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">            </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"Layout first. Paint second."</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">        </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="SnapshotPNG {    Container(        width = 480f,        height = 280f,        padding = EdgeInsets.all(24f),        decoration = BoxDecoration(            color = Color.WHITE,            borderRadius = BorderRadius.circular(24f),        ),    ) {        Column {            Text(&#x22;A structured image&#x22;)            SizedBox(height = 12f)            Text(&#x22;Layout first. Paint second.&#x22;)        }    }}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="文本与图片" __collectHeading="true">文本与图片</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#文本与图片"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “文本与图片”</span></a></div><p><code>Text</code> 用于单段文本，<code>RichText</code> / <code>TextSpan</code> 用于混合样式；<code>RawImage</code> 接受已有 Skia <code>Image</code>，<code>ProviderImage</code> 通过 provider 获取图片并在构造 Widget 时立即调用，<code>CachedNetworkImage</code> 提供网络图片缓存。</p><p>图片加载是同步行为。如果在服务端使用网络图片，建议自行控制超时、缓存与线程模型。</p><p>详细参数分别见<a href="/guides/painting/">绘制、装饰与效果</a>和<a href="/guides/media-text/">图片、文本与富文本</a>。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/guides/layout/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" w