border </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Border.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">all</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFF334155</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">()),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">),</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">) {</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">    </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">Text</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D">"Snapshot"</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">, style </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">TextStyle</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(color </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">0xFFF8FAFC</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">toInt</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(), fontSize </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#F78C6C;--1:#AA0982">28f</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">))</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="Container(    width = 360f,    height = 180f,    padding = EdgeInsets.all(24f),    margin = EdgeInsets.all(12f),    alignment = BoxAlignment.CENTER_LEFT,    decoration = BoxDecoration(        color = 0xFF0F172A.toInt(),        borderRadius = BorderRadius.circular(20f),        border = Border.all(color = 0xFF334155.toInt()),    ),) {    Text(&#x22;Snapshot&#x22;, style = TextStyle(color = 0xFFF8FAFC.toInt(), fontSize = 28f))}"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="限制与常见问题" __collectHeading="true">限制与常见问题</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#限制与常见问题"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “限制与常见问题”</span></a></div><ul><li><code>color</code> 与 <code>decoration</code> 不能同时设置；需要“颜色 + 圆角/边框”时，把颜色放进 <code>BoxDecoration</code>。</li><li><code>clipBehavior != NONE</code> 时必须提供 <code>decoration</code>，因为裁剪路径来自装饰对象。</li><li>无子节点、无约束的 <code>Container()</code> 在无界根约束下会收缩为零尺寸；作为根节点出图时应提供非零宽高或有尺寸的子节点。</li><li><code>transform</code> 只影响绘制，不会改变父节点看到的布局尺寸。</li></ul><p>相关页面：<a href="/widgets/painting/decorated-box/">BoxDecoration</a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/constrained-box/">ConstrainedBox</a>、<a href="/widgets/layout/transform/">Transform</a>。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/guides/media-text/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17 11H9.41l3.3-3.29a1.004 1.004 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-5 5a1 1 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 0 .76 1 1 0 0 0 .21.33l5 5a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 1.639-.325 1 1 0 0 0-.219-1.095L9.41 13H17a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">上一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">图片、文本与富文本</span></span></a><a href="/widgets/layout/sized-box/" rel="next" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17.92 11.62a1.001 1.001 0 0 0-.21-.33l-5-5a1.003 1.003 0 1 0-1.42 1.42l3.3 3.29H7a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h7.59l-3.3 3.29a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 .325 1.639 1 1 0 0 0 1.095-.219l5-5a1 1 0 0 0 .21-.33 1 1 0 0 0 0-.76Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">下一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">SizedBox</span></span></a></div></footer></div></div></main></div></div></div></div><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a454d6d2cf4b5c3d',t:'MTc5MTEyMzc1MA=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=fun