/span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Positioned</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Stack</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Snapshot</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="<Snapshot background=&#x22;#020617&#x22; type=&#x22;png&#x22;>  <Stack alignment=&#x22;TOP_LEFT&#x22;>    <Container width=&#x22;640&#x22; height=&#x22;360&#x22; color=&#x22;#0F172A&#x22; />    <Positioned left=&#x22;32&#x22; top=&#x22;28&#x22; right=&#x22;32&#x22;>      <Column crossAxisAlignment=&#x22;START&#x22;>        <Text color=&#x22;#38BDF8&#x22; fontSize=&#x22;16&#x22; fontStyle=&#x22;BOLD&#x22;>SNAPSHOT REPORT</Text>        <Container height=&#x22;16&#x22; />        <Text color=&#x22;#F8FAFC&#x22; fontSize=&#x22;36&#x22; fontStyle=&#x22;BOLD&#x22;>Declarative image rendering</Text>        <Container height=&#x22;12&#x22; />        <Text color=&#x22;#94A3B8&#x22; fontSize=&#x22;20&#x22;>Widget tree → layout → Skia → image</Text>      </Column>    </Positioned>    <Positioned right=&#x22;32&#x22; bottom=&#x22;28&#x22;>      <Border border=&#x22;1 SOLID #334155&#x22; borderRadius=&#x22;16&#x22; boxShadow=&#x22;ELEVATION_4&#x22;>        <Container padding=&#x22;(10,16)&#x22; color=&#x22;#1E293B&#x22;>          <Text color=&#x22;#E2E8F0&#x22; fontSize=&#x22;16&#x22;>PNG · JPEG · WebP</Text>        </Container>      </Border>    </Positioned>  </Stack></Snapshot>"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><aside aria-label="Parser 能力与 Kotlin DSL 不完全相同" class="starlight-aside starlight-aside--note"><p class="starlight-aside__title" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="starlight-aside__icon astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1em;"><path d="M12 11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm.38-3.92a1 1 0 0 0-.76 0 1 1 0 0 0-.33.21 1.15 1.15 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 .21 1.09c.097.088.209.16.33.21A1 1 0 0 0 13 8a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29-.71 1 1 0 0 0-.33-.21ZM12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20Zm0 18a8 8 0 1 1 0-16.001A8 8 0 0 1 12 20Z"/></svg>Parser 能力与 Kotlin DSL 不完全相同</p><div class="starlight-aside__content"><p>Parser 已覆盖常用布局、Flex、约束、变换、裁剪与基础滤镜能力，但仍不是全部 Kotlin DSL 的一一映射。<code>Stack</code> / <code>IndexedStack</code> 现支持 <code>fit</code> 和 <code>clipBehavior</code>；任意路径的 <code>ClipPath</code>、复杂滤镜等仍需 Kotlin DSL。模板设计应以标签参考为准。</p></div></aside><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="图片来源与扩展" __collectHeading="true">图片来源与扩展</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#图片来源与扩展"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “图片来源与扩展”</span></a></div><p><code>Image</code> 和文本内的 <code>Emoji</code> 必须且只能设置 <code>url</code> 或 <code>dataUri</code>。前者同步访问网络；默认 Data URI 解码器只支持 PNG、JPEG、WebP 的 Base64 内容，可通过 <code>Parser(dataUriImageDecoder = ...)</code> 注入自定义实现。<code>noCache</code> 仅适用于 URL。默认每个 <code>Parser</code> 拥有独立的标签注册表；自定义标签可基于 <code>WidgetParserManager.withDefaults()</code> 注册。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="文本中的特殊字符" __collectHeading="true">文本中的特殊字符</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#文本中的特殊字符"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “文本中的特殊字符”</span></a></div><p>解析器不做 HTML 实体解码。文本中要包含 <code>&lt;</code> 或 <code>&gt;</code> 时，使用 CDATA：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="xml"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">&#x3C;![CDATA[</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">ken_test &#x3C;a>&#x3C;/a> 233</span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">]]></span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="<Text><![CDATA[ken_test <a></a> 233]]></Text>"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p><code>Text</code> 会裁剪首尾空白；需要保留原始空白时使用 <code>Raw</code>。非文本标签中不能出现非空白原始文本。</p><p><code>&lt;!-- ... --&gt;</code> 注释可位于根标签前后、标签之间和文本中，解析时会被忽略；空注释 <code>&lt;!----&gt;</code> 也有效：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="xml"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">&#x3C;!-- 页面说明 --></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Snapshot</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">&#x3C;!----></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">前</span><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">&#x3C;!-- 不显示 --></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">后</span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">&#x3C;![CDATA[</span><span style="--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0">&#x3C;!-- 原文 --></span><span style="--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111">]]></span><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Text</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--1:#8844AE"><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">&#x3C;/</span><span style="--0:#CAECE6">Snapshot</span><span style="--0:#7FDBCA">></span></span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F">&#x3C;!-- 结束说明 --></span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="<!-- 页面说明 --><Snapshot>  <!---->  <Text>前<!-- 不显示 -->后<![CDATA[<!-- 原文 -->]]></Text></Snapshot><!-- 结束说明 -->"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>上例的文本内容为 <code>前后&lt;!-- 原文 --&gt;</code>：CDATA 内的注释样式字符仍按原文保留。注释必须以 <code>--&gt;</code> 结束，否则在 EOF 处抛出 <code>ParseException</code>；CDATA 未闭合时则会将已读取内容作为文本输出，行为与注释不同。<code>&lt;!DOCTYPE ...&gt;</code> 仍不受支持。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="错误处理" __collectHeading="true">错误处理</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#错误处理"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “错误处理”</span></a></div><p>结构错误和属性错误会包装为 <code>ParseException</code>，错误信息带有行、列和偏移。根标签属性在 <code>parse()</code> 时校验，其他标签属性在 <code>createWidget()</code> / <code>snapshot()</code> 时校验；空文档也会抛 <code>ParseException</code>。HTTP 服务可以把它作为 400 Bad Request；布局尺寸为空或无限则更适合作为 422 Unprocessable Content。</p><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="安全边界" __collectHeading="true">安全边界</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#安全边界"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “安全边界”</span></a></div><aside aria-label="Parser 不是安全沙箱" class="starlight-aside starlight-aside--danger"><p class="starlight-aside__title" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="starlight-aside__icon astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1em;"><path d="M12 7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v4a1 1 0 0 0 2 0V8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 0 0 2 1 1 0 0 0 0-2Zm9.71-7.44-5.27-5.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.71-.29H8.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.71.29L2.29 7.56a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29.71v7.46c.004.265.107.518.29.71l5.27 5.27c.192.183.445.286.71.29h7.46a1.05 1.05 0 0 0 .71-.29l5.27-5.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0 .29-.71V8.27a1.05 1.05 0 0 0-.29-.71ZM20 15.31 15.31 20H8.69L4 15.31V8.69L8.69 4h6.62L20 8.69v6.62Z"/></svg>Parser 不是安全沙箱</p><div class="starlight-aside__content"><p>当输入来自用户时，不应把 Parser 当作完整安全沙箱。特别是 <code>Image</code> 和 <code>Emoji</code> 可以发起同步网络请求。服务端至少应在外层限制请求大小、解析深度、可访问域名、私网地址、下载体积、连接超时、渲染总时长和并发量，并为网络图片提供自定义的安全 <code>NetworkImageCache</code> 实现。</p></div></aside><p>错误分类、HTTP 映射和自定义标签见<a href="/reference/parser-errors/">错误处理与扩展</a>。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/widgets/text/image-emoji-span/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17 11H9.41l3.3-3.29a1.004 1.004 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-5 5a1 1 0 0 0-.21.33 1 1 0 0 0 0 .76 1 1 0 0 0 .21.33l5 5a1.002 1.002 0 0 0 1.639-.325 1 1 0 0 0-.219-1.095L9.41 13H17a1 1 0 0 0 0-2Z"/></svg><span class="astro-6i6fca44">上一页<br class="astro-6i6fca44"><span class="link-title astro-6i6fca44">ImageEmojiSpan</span></span></a><a href="/reference/parser-tags/" rel="next" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M17.92 11.62a1.001 1.001 0 0 0-.21-.33l-5-5a1.003 1.003 0 1 0-1.42 1.4