0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “你将得到什么”</span></a></div><p>Snapshot 把一棵 Widget 树先布局，再交给 Skia 绘制，最后返回图片字节。最小的出图流程只有一个根节点：</p><div class="expressive-code"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ec.w36nc.css"><script data-cfasync="false" type="module" src="/_astro/ec.0vx5m.js"></script><figure class="frame not-content"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="kotlin"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">import</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> com.muedsa.snapshot.SnapshotPNG</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">import</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> com.muedsa.snapshot.widget.Container</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">import</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> org.jetbrains.skia.Color</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">import</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> java.io.File</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code">
