+</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">canvas.</span><span style="--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0">drawRenderBox</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">(</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">renderBox </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> root,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">background </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> Color.WHITE,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">    </span></span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">debug </span><span style="--0:#C792EA;--1:#8844AE">=</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53"> </span><span style="--0:#FF6A83;--1:#A24848">true</span><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">,</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="code"><span style="--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53">)</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy"><div aria-live="polite"></div><button title="复制到剪贴板" data-copied="复制成功！" data-code="val root: RenderBox = layoutWidget {    Container(width = 200f, height = 100f)}canvas.drawRenderBox(    renderBox = root,    background = Color.WHITE,    debug = true,)"><div></div></button></div></figure></div><p>这条路径适合测试、布局自省以及把 Snapshot 接到已有 Skia 渲染循环中。</p></article></div><footer class="sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"><div class="meta sl-flex astro-lyrtiueh"></div><div class="pagination-links print:hidden astro-6i6fca44" dir="ltr"><a href="/guides/quickstart/" rel="prev" class="astro-6i6fca44"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="astro-6i6fca44 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="