 Widget DSL</span></p><div class="body astro-x3chvmm6"><p>使用 <code>Container</code>、<code>Row</code>、<code>Column</code>、<code>Stack</code>、<code>Text</code> 与 <code>Image</code> 组合版面，把图片结构直接表达在代码中。</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><p class="title sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-x3chvmm6 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="m21.32 9.55-1.89-.63.89-1.78A1 1 0 0 0 20.13 6L18 3.87a1 1 0 0 0-1.15-.19l-1.78.89-.63-1.89A1 1 0 0 0 13.5 2h-3a1 1 0 0 0-.95.68l-.63 1.89-1.78-.89A1 1 0 0 0 6 3.87L3.87 6a1 1 0 0 0-.19 1.15l.89 1.78-1.89.63a1 1 0 0 0-.68.94v3a1 1 0 0 0 .68.95l1.89.63-.89 1.78A1 1 0 0 0 3.87 18L6 20.13a1 1 0 0 0 1.15.19l1.78-.89.63 1.89a1 1 0 0 0 .95.68h3a1 1 0 0 0 .95-.68l.63-1.89 1.78.89a1 1 0 0 0 1.13-.19L20.13 18a1 1 0 0 0 .19-1.15l-.89-1.78 1.89-.63a1 1 0 0 0 .68-.94v-3a1 1 0 0 0-.68-.95ZM20 12.78l-1.2.4A2 2 0 0 0 17.64 16l.57 1.14-1.1 1.1-1.11-.6a2 2 0 0 0-2.79 1.16l-.4 1.2h-1.59l-.4-1.2A2 2 0 0 0 8 17.64l-1.14.57-1.1-1.1.6-1.11a2 2 0 0 0-1.16-2.82l-1.2-.4v-1.56l1.2-.4A2 2 0 0 0 6.36 8l-.57-1.11 1.1-1.1L8 6.36a2 2 0 0 0 2.82-1.16l.4-1.2h1.56l.4 1.2A2 2 0 0 0 16 6.36l1.14-.57 1.1 1.1-.6 1.11a2 2 0 0 0 1.16 2.79l1.2.4v1.59ZM12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8Zm0 6a2 2 0 1 1 0-4 2 2 0 0 1 0 4Z"/></svg><span class="astro-x3chvmm6">确定性的离线渲染</span></p><div class="body astro-x3chvmm6"><p>布局、绘制、图层和编码分层组织，适合服务端出图、报告、数据卡片与自动化素材生成。</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><p class="title sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-x3chvmm6 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="M9 10h1a1 1 0 1 0 0-2H9a1 1 0 0 0 0 2Zm0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h6a1 1 0 0 0 0-2H9Zm11-3.06a1.3 1.3 0 0 0-.06-.27v-.09c-.05-.1-.11-.2-.19-.28l-6-6a1.07 1.07 0 0 0-.28-.19h-.09a.88.88 0 0 0-.33-.11H7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v14a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h10a3