rrentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.5rem;"><path d="M19.33 10.18a1 1 0 0 1-.77 0 1 1 0 0 1-.62-.93l.01-1.83-8.2 8.2a1 1 0 0 1-1.41-1.42l8.2-8.2H14.7a1 1 0 0 1 0-2h4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4.25a1 1 0 0 1-.62.93Z"/><path d="M11 4a1 1 0 1 1 0 2H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v4a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H7a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V7a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h4Z"/></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="sl-markdown-content"><article><div class="sl-heading-wrapper level-h2"><h2 id="snapshot-是什么" __collectHeading="true">Snapshot 是什么？</h2><a class="sl-anchor-link" href="#snapshot-是什么"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sl-anchor-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42m8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42 1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33M8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 .71.29 1 1 0 0 0 .71-.29l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only" data-pagefind-ignore="">Section titled “Snapshot 是什么？”</span></a></div><p>Snapshot 是一个基于 Kotlin 与 Skia 的 JVM 声明式出图库。它借鉴 Flutter 的 Widget 树、约束布局和分层绘制模型，让复杂图片不再依赖难以维护的 Canvas 坐标代码。</p><div class="card-grid stagger astro-o6hxowxi"><article class="card sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><p class="title sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-x3chvmm6 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="M17 6.06a3 3 0 0 0-1.15 5.77A2 2 0 0 1 14 13.06h-4a4 4 0 0 0-2 .56V7.88a3 3 0 1 0-2 0v8.36a3 3 0 1 0 2.16.05A2 2 0 0 1 10 15.06h4a4 4 0 0 0 3.91-3.16A3 3 0 0 0 17 6.06m-10-2a1 1 0 1 1-1 1 1 1 0 0 1 1-1m0 16a1 1 0 1 1 1-1 1 1 0 0 1-1 1m10-10a1 1 0 1 1 1-1 1 1 0 0 1-1 1"/></svg><span class="astro-x3chvmm6">声明式 Widget DSL</span></p><div class="body astro-x3chvmm6"><p>使用 <code>Container</code>、<code>Row</code>、<code>Column</code>、<code>Stack</code>、<code>Text</code> 与 <code>Image</code> 组合版面，把图片结构直接表达在代码中。</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><p class="title sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-x3chvmm6 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="m21.32 9.55-1.89-.63.89-1.78A1 1 0 0 0 20.13 6L18 3.87a1 1 0 0 0-1.15-.19l-1.78.89-.63-1.89A1 1 0 0 0 13.5 2h-3a1 1 0 0 0-.95.68l-.63 1.89-1.78-.89A1 1 0 0 0 6 3.87L3.87 6a1 1 0 0 0-.19 1.15l.89 1.78-1.89.63a1 1 0 0 0-.68.94v3a1 1 0 0 0 .68.95l1.89.63-.89 1.78A1 1 0 0 0 3.87 18L6 20.13a1 1 0 0 0 1.15.19l1.78-.89.63 1.89a1 1 0 0 0 .95.68h3a1 1 0 0 0 .95-.68l.63-1.89 1.78.89a1 1 0 0 0 1.13-.19L20.13 18a1 1 0 0 0 .19-1.15l-.89-1.78 1.89-.63a1 1 0 0 0 .68-.94v-3a1 1 0 0 0-.68-.95ZM20 12.78l-1.2.4A2 2 0 0 0 17.64 16l.57 1.14-1.1 1.1-1.11-.6a2 2 0 0 0-2.79 1.16l-.4 1.2h-1.59l-.4-1.2A2 2 0 0 0 8 17.64l-1.14.57-1.1-1.1.6-1.11a2 2 0 0 0-1.16-2.82l-1.2-.4v-1.56l1.2-.4A2 2 0 0 0 6.36 8l-.57-1.11 1.1-1.1L8 6.36a2 2 0 0 0 2.82-1.16l.4-1.2h1.56l.4 1.2A2 2 0 0 0 16 6.36l1.14-.57 1.1 1.1-.6 1.11a2 2 0 0 0 1.16 2.79l1.2.4v1.59ZM12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8Zm0 6a2 2 0 1 1 0-4 2 2 0 0 1 0 4Z"/></svg><span class="astro-x3chvmm6">确定性的离线渲染</span></p><div class="body astro-x3chvmm6"><p>布局、绘制、图层和编码分层组织，适合服务端出图、报告、数据卡片与自动化素材生成。</p></div></article><article class="card sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><p class="title sl-flex astro-x3chvmm6"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="icon astro-x3chvmm6 astro-tynuvajn" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" style="--sl-icon-size: 1.333em;"><path d="M9 10h1a1 1 0 1 0 0-2H9a1 1 0 0 0 0 2Zm0 2a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h6a1 1 0 0 0 0-2H9Zm11-3.06a1.3 1.3 0 0 0-.06-.27v-.09c-.05-.1-.11-.2-.19-.28l-6-6a1.07 1.07 0 0 0-.28-.19h-.09a.88.88 0 0 0-.33-.11H7a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v14a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h10a3